# Pre-ICO Promo Monorepo

Three Laravel apps in one repo:

| App | Path | Role |
|-----|------|------|
| Hub | `hub/` | Filament 3 admin, JSON API, DB of record |
| ARAB | `arab/` | Promo (ar+en RTL), VDS UAE/EU + Cloudflare |
| CHINA | `china/` | Promo (zh_CN+en LTR), VDS HK/SG |

## Architecture

- Hub owns sites, groups, content, leads, analytics, settings.
- Fronts talk to Hub over HTTPS JSON API (Sanctum **site** token). Never share DB with fronts.
- Content on fronts: `HubClient` → cache (5–15 min TTL) → fallback `config/site.php`.
- Leads/events: best-effort POST to Hub; on failure queue/log + retry on the front.

## Sites & groups

- `sites`: `arab`, `china` (slug, domain, locales, API token, status).
- `site_groups`: arbitrary (e.g. `all-preico`, `mena`, `apac`); M2M with sites.
- Filament context switcher: **All / Group / Site** on resources and dashboard.

## Content model

- Structured sections: `section_key` + JSON payload; status `draft|published`.
- **Global/Group** applies to all sites in scope; **Site override** for ARAB/CHINA-only fields.
- Locales stored in Hub (`ar` / `zh_CN` / `en`).

## Compliance

- CHINA public copy: no «ICO» / «cryptocurrency» wording.
- External analytics (GA4, Yandex, Baidu) supplement Hub first-party events; Hub is admin truth.

## Out of MVP

WeChat Mini Program, headless CMS, live FX API, AMP, real KYC/audit SSO beyond site tokens.
